        {
          "text": " Tena nitawaagizia mahali watu wangu Israeli, nami nitawapanda, wapate kukaa mahali pao wenyewe, wasiondolewe tena; wala wana wa uovu hawatawatesa tena, kama hapo kwanza; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.7.10",
